  "title": "taps: Add preference for stats_tree output",
  "description": "Add a preference for the default output format for statistical taps,\nfor use with TShark -z. Use the enum already used for Save As with\nthe taps dialogs.\n\nOnly supported by taps using the stats_tree system currently honor\nthis. It would be useful to add other taps.\n\nExample Use:\n\ntshark -r <file> -z http2,tree -q -o statistics.output_format:csv\n\nPing #10759",
